                                "sense_id": "4fb43549-5f79-3afa-b4b2-8937d86b5d26",
                                "text": "We believe that this sans-culotte Pillet or Pillard, Pendard or Fuyard, was so put to his shifts that the want of both might have chasséd him from decent society."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b686bd39-6b17-4ce5-9094-6da560c6ab18",
                                "sense_id": "4fb43549-5f79-3afa-b4b2-8937d86b5d26",
                                "text": "Garrick soon found out this double dealing, and chasséd him promptly."
